      "Pathogenic variants in nuclear genes encoding mitochondrial oxidative phosphorylation components (e.g., NDUFS1, NDUFV1)",
      "Mitochondrial DNA depletion or multiple deletions may be present",
      "Autosomal recessive inheritance"
    ],
